==== hyperbricks yaml {!{hypermedia}} ====
css:
  - type: html
  - value: |2
      <style>
          body {
              padding:20px;
          }
      </style>
hypermedia:
  - type: hypermedia
  - tree_10:
      - type: tree
      - html_1:
          - type: html
          - value: <p>SOME CONTENT</p>
  - head:
      - type: head
      - html_10:
          - type: html
          - value: |2
              <style>
                  body {
                      padding:20px;
                  }
              </style>
      - css_20:
          - type: css
          - inline: "\n.content {\n    color:green;\n}\n    "
==== explainer ====
HYPERMEDIA type is the main initiator of a htmx document. Its location is defined by the route property. Use <FRAGMENT> to utilize hx-[method] (GET,POST etc) requests.
